   * translator (part of beamer)
   * l3build (for building)
   * and more

LaTeX based reports:
 * pdflatex and packages:
   * PGF/TikZ
   * translator (part of beamer)
 * siunitx

Import of other image formats (convert, add --convert):
 * python3-opencv
 * Poppler and intros"}}

